    "body": "We don't actually need to make `path_vec` mutable for this right? We can shadow the old variable, e.g.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n    let path_vec = if config.convert_slash { path_vec.iter().for_each(|i| *i = from_slash(i)).collect() } else { path_vec };\r\n```\r\n\r\nthough this also might just be my dislike for mutable state getting the better of me.",
