    "body": "I hate to ask this, but could you move the calls to `from_slash` into the tightest scope possible? In this case, it would be something like \r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n  let expected = Some(&format!(\"{} \", Color::Cyan.bold().paint(from_slash(\"🚀\"))));\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhere the call currently is, it's not obvious from context whether the from_slash call requires a formatted color string, or can work on bare paths. We can add a test that tests this in the current scope if you'd like (after coloring is added), but I think the current tests don't accurately reflect how the function is meant to be used.",
